The N.I.H. Spent one trillion dollars Curing Nothing: How ninety-seven percent of medical research funding avoids testing

72
00:08:11,060 --> 00:08:19,900
drugs in humans. The F.D.A. Is Unsafe and Ineffective: How "safety" regulations make medicine more dangerous.

73
00:08:21,080 --> 00:08:26,320
The Cost of War: eleven point four trillion dollars annually, itemized.

74
00:08:27,400 --> 00:08:32,789
Unrepresentative Democracy: Why zero percent of what you want becomes policy.

75
00:08:33,640 --> 00:08:37,940
You Are a Meat Robot: Your body is a machine, and the parts are fixable.

76
00:08:38,620 --> 00:08:42,860
And if you don't fix it, you are going to die from something that could have been cured.

77
00:08:43,460 --> 00:08:51,040
Personally. You. The person reading this. While the Pentagon loses another trillion dollars between the sofa cushions of

78
00:08:51,040 --> 00:08:51,800
its accounting department.
